  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div><div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/0x0SojalSec\" data-status=\"active\" aria-current=\"page\"><p><img alt=\"@0x0SojalSec\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"40px\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_normal.jpg\" srcset=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_x96.jpg 96w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_reasonably_small.jpg 128w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_200x200.jpg 200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_400x400.jpg 400w\"></p></a></div><p><span>The Cyber-OSINT model that You can run locally.\n\n- MoE (26B total, 4B active, 262K ctx) trained on 6,500 OSINT/CTI instructions.\n- SFT for cyber threat intel and investigative work.\n- Threat-actor attribution. \n- IoC pivoting. Geolocation. \n- Admiralty source grading.\n- 262K context.</span></p><div><div><p><a aria-label=\"Image\" href=\"https://twitter.com/0x0SojalSec/status/2104736980768866439/photo/1\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1214\" width=\"1625\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTWF3-bbgAAAs54?format=webp&amp;name=large\" srcset=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTWF3-bbgAAAs54?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTWF3-bbgAAAs54?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTWF3-bbgAAAs54?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w\"></a></p></div><div data-href=\"/0x0SojalSec/status/2104734886406050292\" data-timeline-entry=\"\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\"><article><div><div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/0x0SojalSec\" data-status=\"active\" aria-current=\"page\"><p><img alt=\"@0x0SojalSec\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"24px\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_normal.jpg\" srcset=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_x96.jpg 96w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_reasonably_small.jpg 128w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_200x200.jpg 200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007035104158482432/yKGFeKJD_400x400.jpg 400w\"></p></a></div><p><span>a 7B cyber model that fits on locally 8GB GPU. - finetuned cyber/DevOps post-training datasets for offensive and defensive work.\n- 32K native. \n- 131K with YaRN.\n\nMost security model are a system prompt. \nThis one is an actual finetune.\n\n- </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/DeepHat/DeepHat-V1-7B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">huggingface.co/DeepHat/DeepHa…</a></p></div><div><p><a aria-label=\"Image\" href=\"https://twitter.com/0x0SojalSec/status/2104734886406050292/photo/1\"><img fetchpriority=\"low\" height=\"1216\" width=\"1798\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTWD7f6b0AAlSV3?format=webp&amp;name=large\" srcset=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTWD7f6b0AAlSV3?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTWD7f6b0AAlSV3?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTWD7f6b0AAlSV3?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w\"></a></p></div></article></div></div></div></div>",
